All,

Sorry for the late notice, but I haven't seen anyone post anything here =
about it...  OpenPrinting has several discussions scheduled for the =
upcoming Linux Plumber's Conference from September 20-24.  =
OpenPrinting's sessions are on the 20th from 10am to 2pm US Eastern =
Time:

    https://linuxplumbersconf.org/event/11/timetable/#all.detailed

You can watch live via YouTube - links to be posted here:

    https://linuxplumbersconf.org/event/11/page/107-watch-live-free

I'm not sure what the participation mechanisms are, but if you have =
specific questions for the CUPS sessions please feel free to send me an =
email and I'll be sure to bring them up/answer them.

________________________
Michael Sweet




